+`picomatch` reaches the client only through build/test tooling (vite, vitest,
+tailwindcss, typescript-eslint, @types/jest); the deployed client image carries
+no npm package at all. Valid only until EXPIRES, at most 30 days from approval.
+R3 (braces, GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm) expired on 2026-11-05 and braces no longer
+appears in the audit; it is replaced, not extended.
 
 This is deliberately not a general ignore list. Exactly one advisory, one
 package, one installed version, one set of dependents and one expiry are
